*** Keywords ***
General_SiSo_Auto_EDSM_transitions_with_CB010766
    [Documentation]     Purpose of this test case is to verify BTS support of state transitions: enabling, entering EDSM
    ...                 and exiting it through feature CB010766 (Dedicated Time Windows for Deep Sleep).
    ...                 NOTE: User should select the appropriate method for switching off carriers: 'lock' or 'block'.
    ...                 NOTE: Radio Module Starts EDSM reentry timer with a timeout of 2 hours after previous EDSM entry.
    ...                       That's why `Wait For EDSM Timer If Needed` and `Set EDSM Timer` keywords must be used in EDSM test cases.
    ...                       to ensure that the test cases can be executed reliably with waiting for 2 hours between EDSM entries.
    ...
    ...       ARGS:
    ...       - cell_disable_method:  method used for cell to switch off carriers, can be either 'lock' or 'block'; defaults to 'lock'
    ...       - deep_sleep_window_duration: extreme deep sleep time schedule window duration in minutes; defaults to 35
    ...       - throughputs: dict with throughput and deviation values for all cells, example:
    ...                                    throughput_100MHz = {
    ...                                         '827736065':
    ...                                             {
    ...                                                 'throughput':
    ...                                                     {
    ...                                                         'downlink': '100 Mbits/sec',
    ...                                                         'uplink': '15 Mbits/sec'
    ...                                                     },
    ...                                                 'info': '-',
    ...                                                 'deviation': '90%'
    ...                                               };
    ...       - config_rmods_ids: list of configuration IDs of RMODs which should be checked;
    ...                           defaults to ${None} (test will be performed on all RMODS detected in current BTS configuration)
    ...       - call_duration: duration of data transfer test in Robot time string format
    ...                        e.g. '1 minutes 42 seconds' or '1min 42s'; defaults to 30s
    ...       - protocol: data transfer protocol; defaults to udp
    ...       - udp_buffer: monitoring data buffer; defaults to 4M
    ...       - tput_verification_via_btslog: True - throughput verification will be performed using btslog,
    ...                                       False - throughput verification will be performed using iperf; defaults to True
    ...       - ue_network_modes: dictionary with pairs of UE serial number - desired network mode e.g. {"SN1234": "NR_only", "SN321": "NR_only}
    ...                           possible network modes: NR_only, LTE_only, NR_LTE (NR_LTE mode CAN NOT be used with any of the other
    ...                           two in case of more than one UE); defaults to ${None} (current modes set on UEs will be used)
    ...       - called_cells_distnames: configuration distnames of cells that will be called, eg: MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/NRCELL-0, if not given,
    ...                                 list of all cells on testline will be determined and called; defaults to ${None}
    ...       - custom_rmod_setup_yaml_path: path to custom RMOD setup YAML file used for RU connection initialization;
    ...                                      defaults to ${None}, which means default database parameters will be used.

    [Arguments]                                                 ${throughputs}
    ...                                                         ${cell_disable_method}='lock'
    ...                                                         ${deep_sleep_window_duration}=35
    ...                                                         ${config_rmods_ids}=${None}
    ...                                                         ${call_duration}=30s
    ...                                                         ${protocol}=udp
    ...                                                         ${udp_buffer}=4M
    ...                                                         ${tput_verification_via_btslog}=${True}
    ...                                                         ${ue_network_modes}=${None}
    ...                                                         ${called_cells_distnames}=${None}
    ...                                                         ${custom_rmod_setup_yaml_path}=${None}

    Wait For EDSM Timer If Needed

    Input Argument Validation                                   cell_disable_method=${cell_disable_method}
    ${bts_type}=                                                testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}=                                              connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                                         bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${config_rmods_ids}=                                         Run Keyword If  not ${config_rmods_ids}
    ...                                                         admin_info_model.get_rmod_indexes
    ...                                                         connection=${connection}
    ...                                                         ELSE
    ...                                                         Set Variable   ${config_rmods_ids}
    ${cells_status_variant}                                     Priv Get Cell Status Variant
    ...                                                         cell_disable_method=${cell_disable_method}

    FOR  ${config_rmod_id}  IN  @{config_rmods_ids}
        ${rmod_config_distname}=                                admin_info_model.get_config_distname_for_rmod
        ...                                                     config_rmod_id=${config_rmod_id}
        ...                                                     connection=${connection}
        ${rmod_internal_distname}=                              admin_info_model.translate_rmod_distname
        ...                                                     rmod_distname=${rmod_config_distname}
        ...                                                     output_distname_type=internal
         ...                                                    connection=${connection}
        ${rmod_id}=                                             Evaluate  int(str("""${rmod_config_distname}""").split('-')[-1])
        ${start_datetime}  ${start_time}  ${wake_datetime}      Get Deep Sleep Time Schedule and RMOD Wake Up Time
        ...                                                     deep_sleep_time=${deep_sleep_window_duration}
        Enable Deep Sleep Time Schedule                         rmod_config_distname=${rmod_config_distname}
        ...                                                     start_time=${start_time}
        ...                                                     window_duration=${deep_sleep_window_duration}
        ...                                                     time_for_ru_restore=0
        Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                             ${deep_sleep_window_duration}min  30s
        ...                                                     Time Is Reached
        ...                                                     datetime=${start_datetime}
        Set Test Variable                                       ${return_to_initial_scf}
        ...                                                     ${True}
        Enable EnergySaving                                     rmod_config_distname=${rmod_config_distname}
        ...                                                     energySaving_param_value=DEEPSLEEP_EXTREME_SFP
        Run keyword if      ${cell_disable_method}=='lock'      Lock Cells And Wait For SLEEP State On RMOD
        ...                                                     rmod_config_distname=${rmod_config_distname}
        ...                                                     expected_energy_saving=DEEPSLEEP_EXTREME_SFP
        ...                                                     expected_power_state=SLEEP_EXTREME
        ...      ELSE IF    ${cell_disable_method}=='block'     Block Cells And Wait For SLEEP State On RMOD
        ...                                                     rmod_config_distname=${rmod_config_distname}
        ...                                                     expected_energy_saving=DEEPSLEEP_EXTREME_SFP
        ...                                                     expected_power_state=SLEEP_EXTREME
        Check operational state of cells for RU                 operational_state=disabled
        ...                                                     config_rmod_id=${config_rmod_id}
        ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
        ...                                                     connection=${connection}
        Check if RU in EDSM is not reachable via LMI board      config_rmod_id=${config_rmod_id}
        ...                                                     connection=${connection}
        ...                                                     custom_rmod_setup_yaml_path=${custom_rmod_setup_yaml_path}
        Wait For The End Of Deep Sleep Window                   rmod_config_distname=${rmod_config_distname}
        ...                                                     start_datetime=${start_datetime}
        ...                                                     wake_datetime=${wake_datetime}
        ...                                                     deep_sleep_time=${deep_sleep_window_duration}
        ...                                                     expected_energy_saving=DEEPSLEEP_EXTREME_SFP
        Exit EDSM via Radio Autonomus Reset                     config_rmod_id=${config_rmod_id}
        ...                                                     connection=${connection}
        ...                                                     cells_status_variant=${cells_status_variant}
        Run keyword if      ${cell_disable_method}=='lock'      Unlock cells on RMOD and check statuses
        ...                                                     rmod_internal_distname=${rmod_internal_distname}
        ...                                                     connection=${connection}
        ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
        ...      ELSE IF    ${cell_disable_method}=='block'     Unblock cells on RMOD and check statuses
        ...                                                     rmod_internal_distname=${rmod_internal_distname}
        ...                                                     connection=${connection}
        ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
        Set EDSM Timer
        Execute L3 call                                         cells_distnames=${called_cells_distnames}
        ...                                                     throughputs=${throughputs}
        ...                                                     protocol=${protocol}
        ...                                                     udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
        ...                                                     duration=${call_duration}
        ...                                                     tput_verification_via_btslog=${tput_verification_via_btslog}
        ...                                                     ue_network_modes=${ue_network_modes}

    END
    [Teardown]                                                  Run keyword if  """${KEYWORD_STATUS}""" == "FAIL"
    ...                                                         Run keyword if     ${cell_disable_method}=='lock'
    ...                                                         Unlock cells on RMOD and check statuses
    ...                                                         rmod_internal_distname=${rmod_internal_distname}
    ...                                                         connection=${connection}
    ...                                                         bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                                         ELSE IF   ${cell_disable_method}=='block'
    ...                                                         Unblock cells on RMOD and check statuses
    ...                                                         rmod_internal_distname=${rmod_internal_distname}
    ...                                                         connection=${connection}
    ...                                                         bts_type=${bts_type}

Input Argument Validation
    [Arguments]                                                 ${cell_disable_method}
    Should Not Be Empty                                         ${cell_disable_method}     msg=${cell_disable_method} is empty! Please provide the correct value.
    Should Contain Any                                          ${cell_disable_method}     lock   block
    ...                                                         msg=${cell_disable_method} should contain 'lock' or 'block'. Please provide the correct value.
